  <!-- GOVUK_GUIDANCE:START (auto-generated - edited content will be overwritten by scripts/update-component-guidance.mjs) -->
        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">When to use this component</h2>
          <p class="govuk-body">Use the Tag component when it’s possible for something to have more than one status and it’s useful for the user to know about that status. For example, you can use a tag to show whether an item in a <a class="govuk-link" href="/components/task-list/">Task list component</a> has been ‘completed’.</p>
        <!-- GOVUK_GUIDANCE:END -->
